div>\n\n  <div class=\"card c3\">\n    <div class=\"c-top\">\n      <span class=\"c-idx\">阶段 03</span>\n      <span class=\"c-dot d3\"></span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"c-name small\">对比分析与写作</div>\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"c-div\"></div>\n      <span class=\"chip\">计划安排</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"notice\">\n    <span class=\"n-tag\">说明</span>\n    <span class=\"n-text\">以上为计划安排，不是已完成进度</span>\n    <span class=\"n-sub\">资料未提供已完成的实验结论与阶段成果</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"foot-tag\">资料性质：虚构测评材料</div>\n  <div class=\"page-no\">4 / 6</div>\n</main>\n</body>\n</html>","reasoning_content":"Let me create a single HTML page with the reference style: cream paper background, sage green and gold accents, serif display font for numbers, timeline layout.\n\nContent:\n- Title: 可行性与进度\n- Subtitle/meta: 计划周期 8 个月\n- Timeline: three segments with month ranges 1–2, 3–5, 6–8\n- Notice: 以上为计划安排，不是已完成进度\n- Page number: 4 / 6\n\nDesign: 1920x1080, top rule, left rail label, top meta, page number, bottom right \"4 / 6\".\n\nTimeline: horizontal axis showing months 1-8, with three blocks proportionally sized 2/8, 3/8, 3/8. Plus three cards below with details.\n\nLet me build it carefully.\n\nLayout:\n- Top rule at y=48, left 96, width 1760.\n- Top meta at left 98, top 61: \"虚构隔振支架研究开题 · 开题评审\"\n- Page no bottom right: \"4 / 6\" at right 96, bottom 56.\n- Title block: left 96, top ~150. Title font-size 84px (Chinese), serif? Chinese with Bodoni not available — use fallback serif stack \"Songti SC\", \"Noto Serif CJK\", Georgia, serif. Actually a Chinese serif title looks nice. Let's use font-family:'Songti SC','SimSun',Georgia,serif for title.\n- Under title a thin accent line and a lead sentence: \"计划周期 8 个月 · 以下时段均为计划安排\" — careful, must not fabricate. Fine.\n\nTimeline band: from x=96 to x=1824, width 1728. Three segments proportional: 2/8=432px, 3/8=648px, 3/8=648px. Good, exact.\n\nBar at y ~ 470, height 8 (or blocks height 90 with labels inside). Let's do: month ticks 1..8 labels below bar.\n\nDesign plan:\n1. Header area: y 130-330. Title \"可行性与进度\" at 96,130 font-size 80. Kicker above: \"04 / 可行性与进度\" maybe. Right side: a card showing \"计划周期 / 8 个月\" big number in serif — that's good visual anchor. Place at right ~1560-1824, top 150.\n\nRight metric card: label \"计划周期\" small caps letterspaced, big \"8\" serif 120px, unit \"个月\".\n\n2. Timeline band y 420-880.\n - Row of segment headers: month ranges.\n - Bar 3 segments with different fills: sage primary, gold, slate blue.\n - Below each segment a card with the phase content.\n\nLet me lay out precisely.\n\nTimeline x start = 96, width total 1728.\nSegment widths: 432, 648, 648.\n\nBar: y=560, height 12? Let's make bar height 96 (blocks) so text inside: \"第 1–2 月\" in white. Then below card.\n\nActually let's do:\n- Month axis labels at y=470: \"1月\"...\"8月\" tick marks — but months labeled as 第1月 etc. Simpler: axis line with ticks at 8 positions.\n\nPlan:\n- y=470: thin axis line from 96 to 1824, with 9 tick marks (start of each month + end).\n- y=490-520: month numbers 1..8 centered in each month column (216px each).\n- y=556: three blocks height 88, gap 0? Use small gaps 6px between segments to show separation. Keep widths: 432-6, 648-... whatever.\n\nThen below blocks at y=690: three cards aligned to the segment columns, height ~230, with:\n  - phase index \"01\" \n  - phase title: \"完成设计\"\n  - detail lines.\n\nHmm, but the requirement each bullet: 第 1–2 月：完成设计; 第 3–5 月：试验准备与数据采集; 第 6–8 月：对比分析与写作.\n\nCard content:\nCard 1: 01 / 第 1–2 月 / 完成设计. detail: 方案与连接参数设计（谨慎 — 大纲说\"完成设计\"; 我可以加\"设计阶段\"描述但不要编造。安全做法：只写\"完成设计\"，副行可以写\"计划\"状态标签）。Maybe add status chip \"计划\" on each card. And avoid extra invented details. I'll keep cards minimal: month range, phase name, and a \"计划\" tag. Maybe add short generic descriptors that don't add facts... risky. Better: minimal text only.\n\nBut then cards look empty. Can fill with: label \"阶段 01\", month range large, phase name, and status chip \"计划安排\". Also a small progress indicator \"—\" for 未开始? Hmm, that's derived from \"试验尚未开展\"? That's page 3 fact; here just \"计划安排，非已完成进度\". I'll add chip \"计划\" to each card. Fine.\n\n3. Bottom note: y ~ 900: a strip with accent left bar: \"以上为计划安排，不是已完成进度。\"\n\nLayout check for heights: title 130-330, timeline 400-880, note 900-980, footer 1000-1030. Good.\n\nLet me write CSS.\n\nColors: bg #F5F2E9, ink #1B2620, muted #5C665D, primary #4F5E43, secondary #B4914A, tertiary #8C9FB2, line #A3AC9E.\n\nBackground decorations: radial gradients, repeating vertical lines, dot field, top rule, left rail vertical text \"FEASIBILITY & SCHEDULE\" rotated? Reference had rail label. I'll add rotated \"可行性与进度\" label on left? Reference used English. I'll put \"FEASIBILITY & SCHEDULE\" rotated at left — but that's English text added; acceptable as decorative? It's not a factual claim. Keep it simple: maybe skip. I'll include a vertical rail with letterspaced English \"SCHEDULE · PLAN ONLY\" — hmm, \"PLAN ONLY\" fine. I'll just use \"FEASIBILITY & SCHEDULE\".\n\nAlso a small circle register at top-right? It's decorative. Maybe put it at right but it may clash with the 8 个月 card. Place register top-right offset -60 as in reference and metric card lower. Might be busy. I'll skip the register and use a simpler right-side composition.\n\nLet me write.\n\n```html\n<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\"/>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;padding:0;width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;background:#F5F2E9;}\n*{box-sizing:border-box;}\n:root{...}\n.slide{position:relative;width:1920px;height:1080px;overflow:hidden;background:#F5F2E9;font-family:...;color:#1B2620}\n```\n\nFonts: Chinese: 'Noto Serif CJK SC','Songti SC','SimSun',serif for display; body: 'Helvetica Neue',Arial,'PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif.\n\nTitle: font-size 76px, letter-spacing 2px? Chinese letter-spacing fine.\n\nLet me write detailed CSS with absolute position